    "turn_idx": 18,
    "turn_text": "quote. Yeah, and he says, you know, it's not the critic who counts It's not the person that's sitting in the audience that matters. It's the man in the arena It's the woman in the arena. It's the person whose face is just smeared with dirt who's just eating it who's falling down Who's trying? That's the only person that matters and when it comes to shaping the national conversation frankly I think it's because there's so few people that are trying on a level where they are risking something of themselves.",
