  {
    "episode_id": 93179,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/3/93179.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 20,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, and I think it's important to reiterate like what brave means and brave. means actually risking something. Like, brave does mean you may fail. Brave does mean, it's not just like, oh, I'm gonna do this thing that's probably gonna succeed. I'm gonna do something with a 70% chance of success. No, brave means you're gonna go in with a 2% chance of success. Bravery is the moonshot. Bravery is, this is probably not gonna work, but it's worth trying. That's what bravery is. Exactly, thank you.",
