        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "High-risk endeavors with low success rates are morally commendable if pursued intentionally.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker’s definition of bravery aligns with widely accepted ethical standards.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "People generally understand 'brave' as involving personal cost or danger.",
