  {
    "episode_id": 93179,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/3/93179.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 26,
    "turn_text": "And I fell on my face and it didn't work out and I tried so many things and I just failed and failed and failed and I remember when I was running in my primary and the thing is like My primary was really tough. Literally, no one endorsed me. They probably wouldn't even stand by you, if",
