    "turn_idx": 56,
    "turn_text": "Oh, I like you. All right, come on, let's do it. Coming from two successful women, I see how being brave and not perfect has led to success. But what do you recommend for young girls who have not found success in their lives or feel like failure is the only thing that might come when they choose to be brave?",
